desc: Kaminari (SCC Taiko Drums port) by chmaha
tags: instrument
author: chmaha
version: 0.1
changelog:
  Initial preview.
about:
  Taiko drums: S. Christian Collins' SCC Taiko Drums played through a port of the sfizz SFZ engine. Fifteen
  drums and hits on key pairs from C2 to A#4 (white key + the black key above it, for easy rolls), with velocity
  layers and round robins; how long a key is held sets how long the drum rings (hold the sustain pedal for full
  decays). Click a drum in the list to hear it.
  Ported from sfizz 1.2.3 (sfizz authors, https://sfz.tools/sfizz, BSD 2-clause).
  Samples: SCC Taiko Drums 1.0 by S. Christian Collins (https://www.schristiancollins.com), mostly from
  Subaqueous' Free Taiko Drum Rack (http://subaqueousmusic.com), CC BY-SA 4.0, with a freesound.org sample by
  whatsanickname4u (CC BY 3.0); joined into one 16-bit FLAC, released under CC BY-SA 4.0
  (Dependencies/Kaminari/Kaminari-LICENSE.txt).
  JSFX code released under GPLv3+ license
  Claude generated some of this code
provides:
  Dependencies/Kaminari/Kaminari.txt
  Dependencies/Kaminari/Kaminari.flac
  Dependencies/Kaminari/Kaminari-LICENSE.txt

